pip
py2app
# setuptools<81: kept on purpose; check whenever the locks are refreshed.
# setuptools 81 removed dry_run from distutils' spawn(), which py2app
# 0.28.9 passed (py2app issue #557). py2app 0.28.10 no longer passes it
# (py2app/util.py byte_compile, which our build reaches through setup.py's
# optimize=2), so the pin is probably no longer needed, but no build has
# been tried with setuptools 81 or newer (checked 2026-10-26).
# To drop it: remove "<81", run build/refresh-python-locks.sh, make one
# ONIONPRESS_RELEASE_BUILD=1 Mac build; if it passes, also delete the
# "py2app failed" retry in build-dmg-simple.sh and rebuild-menubar.sh and
# the below-81 assertion in tests/test_dmg_build_pins.py.
setuptools<81
wheel
